sentences.text:
6. Therefore, these applications for anticipatory bails are allowed and the petitioners are directed to be released on anticipatory bail in the event of their arrest in connection with Crime No.930 of 2023 of Valiathura Police Station, subject to the following conditions:
(i) Petitioners shall execute bonds for sums of Rs.50,000/-
(Rupees fifty thousand only)each with two solvent sureties each for the likesum to the satisfaction of the Arresting officer;
(ii) Petitioners shall appear before the investigating officer in BAIL APPL. NOS. 7679 & 7680 OF 2023 Crime No.930 of 2023 of Valiathura Police Station at 11.00 A.M on 23.09.2023 and thereafter,
whenever called upon to do so;
(iii) The petitioners shall not attempt to contact the de-facto complainant or interfere with the investigation or to influence or intimidate any witness in Crime No.930 of 2023 of Valiathura Police Station;

